  },
  {
   "d": "2026-05-11",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY26",
   "g": "CUT",
   "s": -3,
   "q": "The Group has made a solid start to the second half, though we are mindful of the potential implications for global demand and energy costs given the ongoing events in the Middle East. On a full year basis, the Board expects FY 2026 underlying PBT to be in the range of £42m-£44m.",
