   "d": "2026-07-07",
   "doc": "Q3 TU",
   "fy": "FY26",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "Our full year guidance is therefore unchanged and as previously communicated, the Board expects FY 2026 underlying PBT to be in the range of £42m-£44m.",
